# Präfixe catalog lock (≈ 0.0.540)

User-validated Fallstudie setup — **do not “simplify”, strip, or re-seed differently** without an explicit ask.

## Locked shape (`Case_Data::prefix_catalog_leaves` + `ensure_praefixe_catalog`)

| Piece | Must stay |
|-------|-----------|
| Host Preferred | `ChildListRenderer` |
| Host Choices | `choiceFilter` exclude **Centi** (default hide; leaf still exists) |
| Host attrs | **Presentation** (`node_presentation`, Mult `1`, RO, context **`symbol`**) + **multiplikator** (`double`, Mult `1`, RO+Hide) |
| Leaves | pico…Tera (incl. Giga/Tera); Preferred **`CompactRenderer`**; SI `multiplikator` + Presentation texts; leaf Default override on multiplikator |
| SI factors | pico 1e-12 … Mega 1e6, **Giga 1e9**, **Tera 1e12** — never leave Mega’s factor on Giga/Tera |

## Do / don’t

- **Do** extend via `ensure_praefixe_catalog` / `prefix_catalog_leaves` when the user asks to change the catalog.
- **Do** keep Display Preferred options in the **same control column** as the select (Render/Converter/Validators).
- **Don’t** remove Presentation or multiplikator from the Präfixe host.
- **Don’t** reset Preferred to Form/Table on Präfixe or Compact off prefix leaves “for consistency”.
- **Don’t** clear Centi from the tree just because Choices excludes it.
- **Don’t** treat defining-edge `presentationContext` on inherited rows as child “Settings configured” (inherited → only `inheritedHostOverride`).

## Entry points

- Template: `Case_Data::prefix_catalog_leaves()`, blueprint Konstanten/Präfixe
- Ensure: `Case_Data::ensure_praefixe_catalog()` (called from Konstanten ensure)
- Factors map: `Demo_Data::ensure_prefix_multiplikators()`
